	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0101_trainerw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そういうわけで　あなた！▼
[Digit:3digits Idx="1" ]より　すばやい
ポケモンを　つれていないかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T08:04:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T08:04:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そういうわけで　あなた！▼
[Digit:3digits Idx="1" ]より　すばやい
ポケモンを　連れていないかしら？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T08:04:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T08:04:02" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：Black2ver
・手持ち（ひんし/タマゴを除く）をサーチ
・？？？以上のポケモンが
　いる　→trainerw_03、trainerw_04
　いない→trainerw_06
・0＝３桁の数字（050～200からランダムで決定）（仮）
・数字は一日中固定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:08:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T08:04:02" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
